                                </td>
                                <td>
                                    <span class="badge rounded-pill px-3 py-1 d-inline-flex align-items-center gap-1"
                                          style="background-color: rgba(0, 158, 185, 0.25); color: #4cd7f6;">
                                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 14px;">badge</span>
                                        <span>מנהל משמרת</span>
